# Linka nightly IVFFlat reindex (ADR 0042) - single-host compose deployment
# (ADR 0007). Install on the ONE host running the stack:
#
#   crontab deploy/reindex-vectors.crontab
#
# Or merge this line into the existing partition-maintenance crontab -
# CRON_TZ/LINKA_APP_DIR only need declaring once. Assumes the repo is at
# /opt/linka (override with LINKA_APP_DIR). All times UTC.

CRON_TZ=UTC
LINKA_APP_DIR=/opt/linka

# Rebuild ix_messages_embedding_ivfflat's cluster centroids from current data.
# CONCURRENTLY: no lock on messages, safe to run while the app is live.
0 3 * * *   /opt/linka/scripts/reindex_vectors.sh >> /var/log/linka-reindex-vectors.log 2>&1
